  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "Super Dragon Posts are a defense in the Clan Capital. Although it is unlocked at Capital Hall level 10 in the Capital Peak, they can be rebuilt much earlier in the Dragon Cliffs district, where it can be rebuilt at District Hall level 1 (this requires Capital Hall level 6)."
  ],
